{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "purpose": "Machine-readable audit of the planned 15-domain MMD predictor development cohort. A paired outcome requires LoRA/no-SAE and the same LoRA model with the fixed ImageNet G-SAE, evaluated on identical examples.",
